","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","title":"MaximalCliques","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"}}}